#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/instance-settings.messages.ts:15
msgid "{count, plural, =0 {No active token stops.} one {# token stops working at once.} other {# tokens stop working at once.}} Scripts that use them get \"401 Unauthorized\". Users cannot make new tokens. App tokens and CI identities do not change. You can turn them on again: the tokens that did not expire then work again."
msgstr "{count, plural, =0 {Aucun token actif ne s'arrête.} one {# token s'arrête tout de suite.} other {# tokens s'arrêtent tout de suite.}} Les scripts qui les utilisent reçoivent « 401 Unauthorized ». Les utilisateurs ne peuvent plus créer de tokens. Les tokens des apps et les identités CI ne changent pas. Vous pouvez les réactiver : les tokens non expirés remarchent alors."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:66
msgid "Answer"
msgstr "Réponse"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:21
msgid "Change eu-west-3 in the host to the region of your Amazon SES account. User name and password: the SMTP credentials of Amazon SES, not the access keys of IAM."
msgstr "Remplacez eu-west-3 dans l'hôte par la région de votre compte Amazon SES. Nom d'utilisateur et mot de passe : les identifiants SMTP d'Amazon SES, pas les clés d'accès IAM."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:24
msgid "Host"
msgstr "Hôte"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:39
msgid "Leave it empty for a relay that asks for no authentication."
msgstr "Laissez-le vide pour un relais qui ne demande pas d'authentification."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/instance-settings.module.ts:42
#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/instance-settings.module.ts:44
#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:4
msgid "Mail"
msgstr "E-mails"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:7
msgid "Mail server"
msgstr "Serveur d'e-mail"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:31
msgid "No encryption"
msgstr "Sans chiffrement"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:47
msgid "no-reply@example.com"
msgstr "no-reply@example.com"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:42
msgid "Not set"
msgstr "Non défini"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:14
msgid "Other SMTP server"
msgstr "Autre serveur SMTP"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:40
msgid "Password or API key"
msgstr "Mot de passe ou clé d'API"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/instance-settings.messages.ts:10
msgid "Personal tokens"
msgstr "Tokens personnels"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/instance-settings.messages.ts:22
msgid "Personal tokens turned off"
msgstr "Tokens personnels désactivés"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/instance-settings.messages.ts:21
msgid "Personal tokens turned on"
msgstr "Tokens personnels activés"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:26
msgid "Port"
msgstr "Port"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:13
msgid "Provider"
msgstr "Fournisseur"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:67
msgid "Queue ID"
msgstr "ID dans la file"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:70
msgid "Removes these settings and the saved password. Scylla then uses the mail server of its configuration (SCYLLA_SMTP_URL), or writes the mails to its log."
msgstr "Supprime ces réglages et le mot de passe enregistré. Scylla utilise alors le serveur d'e-mail de sa configuration (SCYLLA_SMTP_URL), ou écrit les e-mails dans son journal."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/instance-settings.messages.ts:7
#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:50
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Enregistrer"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:49
msgid "Scylla"
msgstr "Scylla"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:11
msgid "Scylla has no mail server: it writes the mails to its log and sends none. Set a server here to send them, with no restart."
msgstr "Scylla n'a pas de serveur d'e-mail : il écrit les e-mails dans son journal et n'en envoie aucun. Définissez un serveur ici pour les envoyer, sans redémarrage."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:44
msgid "Scylla keeps it encrypted and never shows it again."
msgstr "Scylla le garde chiffré et ne l'affiche plus jamais."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:73
msgid "Scylla removes the settings of this page and its saved password. The next mails go through the mail server of the configuration of the server. To use this server again, you must type its password again."
msgstr "Scylla supprime les réglages de cette page et le mot de passe enregistré. Les prochains e-mails passent par le serveur d'e-mail de la configuration du serveur. Pour utiliser de nouveau ce serveur, vous devrez saisir de nouveau son mot de passe."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:8
msgid "Scylla sends its mails through this SMTP server. A change applies to the next mail at once, also to the mails that wait."
msgstr "Scylla envoie ses e-mails par ce serveur SMTP. Une modification s'applique aussitôt au prochain e-mail, aussi aux e-mails en attente."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:74
msgid "Scylla uses the mail server of its configuration"
msgstr "Scylla utilise le serveur d'e-mail de sa configuration"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:10
msgid "Scylla uses the mail server of its configuration: {host}. Set a server here to replace it, with no restart."
msgstr "Scylla utilise le serveur d'e-mail de sa configuration : {host}. Définissez un serveur ici pour le remplacer, sans redémarrage."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:27
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Sécurité"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:62
msgid "Send a test mail"
msgstr "Envoyer un e-mail de test"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:60
msgid "Send to"
msgstr "Envoyer à"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:45
msgid "Sender address"
msgstr "Adresse de l'expéditeur"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:48
msgid "Sender name"
msgstr "Nom de l'expéditeur"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:58
msgid "Sends a mail at once through the saved settings, and shows the answer of the mail server."
msgstr "Envoie aussitôt un e-mail avec les réglages enregistrés, et affiche la réponse du serveur d'e-mail."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:65
msgid "Server"
msgstr "Serveur"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:69
msgid "Server default"
msgstr "Valeur par défaut du serveur"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:41
msgid "Set"
msgstr "Défini"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:59
msgid "Set a mail server first: Scylla has none to send the test mail."
msgstr "Définissez d'abord un serveur d'e-mail : Scylla n'en a aucun pour envoyer l'e-mail de test."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/instance-settings.module.ts:29
#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/instance-settings.module.ts:33
#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/instance-settings.messages.ts:4
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Paramètres"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/instance-settings.messages.ts:9
msgid "Settings of this Scylla server. Only instance admins see this page."
msgstr "Les paramètres de ce serveur Scylla. Seuls les admins de l'instance voient cette page."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:25
msgid "smtp.example.com"
msgstr "smtp.example.com"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:30
msgid "STARTTLS"
msgstr "STARTTLS"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:57
msgid "Test mail"
msgstr "E-mail de test"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:34
msgid "The connection is encrypted from the start. Usually port 465."
msgstr "La connexion est chiffrée dès le début. En général le port 465."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:36
msgid "The connection is not encrypted. Use it only for a relay on the same host or on a private network."
msgstr "La connexion n'est pas chiffrée. Utilisez-la seulement pour un relais sur le même hôte ou sur un réseau privé."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:35
msgid "The connection starts plain, then STARTTLS encrypts it. Usually port 587."
msgstr "La connexion commence en clair, puis STARTTLS la chiffre. En général le port 587."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/instance-settings.messages.ts:8
msgid "The limit of the workspaces is saved"
msgstr "La limite des espaces de travail est enregistrée"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:63
msgid "The mail server accepted the mail"
msgstr "Le serveur d'e-mail a accepté l'e-mail"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:5
msgid "The mail server that sends the mails of Scylla: the sign-in links, the invitations and the alerts. Only instance admins see this page."
msgstr "Le serveur d'e-mail qui envoie les e-mails de Scylla : les liens de connexion, les invitations et les alertes. Seuls les administrateurs de l'instance voient cette page."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:51
msgid "The mail settings are saved"
msgstr "Les réglages des e-mails sont enregistrés"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:64
msgid "The mail was not sent"
msgstr "L'e-mail n'a pas été envoyé"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/instance-settings.messages.ts:6
msgid "The number of workspaces that one user can create. The personal workspace does not count, and an instance admin has no limit. A lower number removes no workspace."
msgstr "Le nombre d'espaces de travail qu'un utilisateur peut créer. L'espace personnel ne compte pas, et un administrateur de l'instance n'a pas de limite. Un nombre plus bas ne supprime aucun espace de travail."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:29
msgid "TLS on connect"
msgstr "TLS dès la connexion"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/instance-settings.messages.ts:20
msgid "Turn off"
msgstr "Désactiver"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/instance-settings.messages.ts:13
msgid "Turn off personal tokens?"
msgstr "Désactiver les tokens personnels ?"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/instance-settings.messages.ts:12
msgid "Turning it off asks for a confirmation and shows how many tokens stop. Workspace admins can also turn personal tokens off in their own workspace."
msgstr "La désactivation demande une confirmation et indique combien de tokens s'arrêtent. Les admins d'un espace de travail peuvent aussi désactiver les tokens personnels dans leur espace."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:43
msgid "Type a new one to replace it"
msgstr "Saisissez-en un nouveau pour le remplacer"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:54
msgid "Type a port from 1 to 65535."
msgstr "Saisissez un port de 1 à 65535."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:53
msgid "Type the host of the mail server."
msgstr "Saisissez l'hôte du serveur d'e-mail."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:18
msgid "Type the outgoing server that LWS Panel shows in the settings of your mail address (for example mail26.lwspanel.com). User name: the full mail address. Password: the password of this address."
msgstr "Saisissez le serveur sortant que LWS Panel affiche dans les paramètres de votre adresse e-mail (par exemple mail26.lwspanel.com). Nom d'utilisateur : l'adresse e-mail complète. Mot de passe : le mot de passe de cette adresse."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:55
msgid "Type the password: a user name needs one."
msgstr "Saisissez le mot de passe : un nom d'utilisateur en demande un."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:16
msgid "Type the settings that your mail provider gives."
msgstr "Saisissez les paramètres que donne votre fournisseur d'e-mail."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:71
msgid "Use the server default"
msgstr "Utiliser la valeur par défaut du serveur"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:72
msgid "Use the server default?"
msgstr "Utiliser la valeur par défaut du serveur ?"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:38
msgid "User name"
msgstr "Nom d'utilisateur"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:20
msgid "User name and password: the same Server API token of your Postmark server."
msgstr "Nom d'utilisateur et mot de passe : le même Server API token de votre serveur Postmark."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:17
msgid "User name: the ID of your Scaleway project. Password: an API secret key with the permission to send mails. The sender domain must be verified in Transactional Email."
msgstr "Nom d'utilisateur : l'ID de votre projet Scaleway. Mot de passe : une clé secrète d'API avec la permission d'envoyer des e-mails. Le domaine de l'expéditeur doit être vérifié dans Transactional Email."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:19
msgid "User name: the SMTP login that Brevo shows in SMTP & API. Password: an SMTP key, not an API key."
msgstr "Nom d'utilisateur : l'identifiant SMTP que Brevo affiche dans SMTP & API. Mot de passe : une clé SMTP, pas une clé d'API."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:22
msgid "User name: your Mailjet API key. Password: your Mailjet secret key."
msgstr "Nom d'utilisateur : votre clé d'API Mailjet. Mot de passe : votre clé secrète Mailjet."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/instance-settings.messages.ts:11
msgid "Users can make tokens that act as themselves. When off, every personal token stops working at once. App tokens are not affected."
msgstr "Les utilisateurs peuvent créer des tokens qui agissent en leur nom. Une fois désactivés, tous les tokens personnels s'arrêtent tout de suite. Les tokens des apps ne changent pas."

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/instance-settings.messages.ts:5
msgid "Workspaces per user"
msgstr "Espaces de travail par utilisateur"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:61
msgid "you@example.com"
msgstr "vous@example.com"

#: extensions/scylla-base/src/features/instance-settings/presentation/messages/mail-settings.messages.ts:46
msgid "Your provider must allow this address or its domain."
msgstr "Votre fournisseur doit autoriser cette adresse ou son domaine."
